From 16d3f3826d4192ee3a66fb5f6443f2164b3fcf95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:22:45 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 50/50] policy: take a screenshot on three finger swipe down

add an input monitor based three finger swipe detector from crdroid
and take a full screenshot when it fires, gated by the
three_finger_screenshot secure setting.

crdroid pilfers pointers as soon as three fingers land, which cancels
any three finger touch in apps. pilfer only once the swipe passes the
threshold instead.
